<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Materials cut lead price by 3,000 yen.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Materials cut lead price by 3,000 yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Materials Corp said on Wednesday that it had lowered its selling price for lead by 3,000 yen to 107,000 yen a tonne, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Major Japanese smelters periodically review their selling prices, changing them in line with market prices and currency rates.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
</text>
